 Halloween is a brilliant murder  mystery with breathtaking art and it's  essential reading forever  comic book fan some might call DC the  new frontier Darwyn cooks magnum opus  and you won't hear any disagreement from  us new frontier merges the golden and  silver ages of comics and tackles the  complexity of the superhero paradox  against a cold war backdrop if you want  a graphic novel that puts the best  things about comics in one story look no  further than DC the new frontier what  can we say about the Sandman that hasn't  already been written in the book of  destiny  the mythical series follows Morpheus as  he atones for the past and rebuilds his  kingdom the dream Neil Gaiman  masterpiece engrossed a generation of  comic readers and the Sandman became one  of the first graphic novels to ever  reach the New York Times bestseller list  if you haven't read it do yourself a  favor and clear your weekends so you can  dive in right now anyone who knows  anything about comics knows Batman The  Killing Joke almost thirty years after  its original release it continues to be  one of DC's most popular graphic novels  year in and year out many consider it  the defining Joker story and the dark  twisted tale test the limits of sanity  while showing what makes Batman the  ultimate hero The Killing Joke is a  graphic novel you cannot forget there is  no conversation about great graphic  novels without Watchmen are number two  it follows a group of superheroes that  are pulled out of retirement after their  teammate is murdered and sees them  deteriorate alongside the fabric of  American society as the u.s. creeps  towards World War 3 the genius of  Watchmen is unfathomable and the book is  one of the landmark graphic novels in  the history of comics and finally the  number one DC book every true fan means  is all-star Superman the series explores  what the Man of Steel would do if you  were given one year to live and the  result is that one  harrowing heartfelt and heroic